  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 30</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwa ymbe cyninc sirewe, beo his feores scildig, buton he hine ladige be þam deopestan þe witan gerædan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone plots against the king, he shall forfeit his life, unless he clears himself by the most solemn oath determined upon by the authorities.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa ymb cyninges feoh syrwe, sy he his feores scyldig; ⁊ gif he ladian wille, do þæt be ðæs cynges wergylde oððe mid þryfealdan ordale on Engla lage.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
